@startuml
title What each HIP gates, prices and polices
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor #F7FAFF
skinparam PackageBorderColor #4A78B5
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #EEF5FF
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #4A78B5
skinparam ComponentFontColor #1F3A5F
skinparam ArrowColor #4A78B5
skinparam ArrowFontColor #1F3A5F
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F7FAFF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #4A78B5

package "Entry is priced" {
  [HIP-1: Dutch auction\n31 h, floor 500 HYPE] as A1
  [HIP-3: 500k HYPE staked\n+ shared Dutch auction\nafter the first 3 assets] as A3
  [HIP-4: staking requirement\nstacks, deployment is free,\ncapacity is capped per deployer] as A4
  [Quote asset: 200k HYPE\ncommitted for 3 years] as AQ
  [Aligned quote asset:\n1M HYPE (v1) or 500k x2 (v2)] as AA
}

package "Conduct is policed by validator vote" {
  [HIP-3: irregular market operation\nup to 100 / 50 / 20% by impact] as S3
  [HIP-4: markets contradicting\ntheir template semanticRestriction] as S4
  [Quote asset: peg depth failing\nover a 3-day sample window] as SQ
  [AQAv2: unpaid revenue at the\nsystem interest address, 2%/day] as SA
}

package "Nothing is gated" {
  [HIP-2: no deployer role at all.\nThe strategy is block transition\nlogic, with no operator and\nno keeper transactions] as H2
}

A3 --> S3
A4 --> S4
AQ --> SQ
AA --> SA
A1 --> H2 : hyperliquidityInit\nis a HIP-1 genesis field

note bottom of S3
  Slashed stake is BURNED, not
  distributed to affected users.
  Users are protected by the
  deployer's incentive, not by
  a compensation fund.
end note
@enduml
